                                                "text": "Scots was not ‘banned’ outright — impossible anyway with so many Scots-speaking teachers but, like Gaelic, marginalised by omission."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89f6e9a5-c65a-3f8f-8ad1-52f1adeda8c4",
                                        "entry_id": "cee55e22-4358-35bd-8e05-c9a8fdef7d12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of neglecting to perform an action one has an obligation to do."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
